,11:marek.tally,1684:part marek_claim
  tally 2
  note "T, M2 (issues #167, #114), DONE gate 2, G1 (engine-requirements §3.2, 8.1): lending Marek 2 000 on 2026-03-12 moved net worth that day by -40.96 if Marek is a claim (only that day's spending), by -2 040.96 if he's outside. 14-marek.json: place marek, kind claim; its ledger rows, bank rows on konto, each in a version that covers konto on its day beside the month's record. Read with the bank run (reality.tally, bank.tally, records/); net worth's change on the day is the flows of the household's places, outside places left out in writing (L §3.6, D-1). Its twin is marek_out.tally: the same rows, marek outside."

source marek_case "the prototype's block 14-marek.json (engine/spec/verification/blocks/cases): Marek jest nam winien 2 000 zł, oddał już 1 200"

place marek: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..

version marek_rows
  cite marek_case
  governs 2026-03-12..2026-03-12
  known 2026-10-17
  covers konto
  bank[m20260312] = (on: 2026-03-12, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to marek amount 2000.00 PLN) "14-marek.json ledger row 0, pozyczka"

version marek_rows_06
  cite marek_case
  governs 2026-06-30..2026-06-30
  known 2026-10-17
  covers konto
  bank[m20260630] = (on: 2026-06-30, kind: transfers, leg cash from marek to konto amount 700.00 PLN) "14-marek.json ledger row 1, pozyczka"

version marek_rows_09
  cite marek_case
  governs 2026-09-15..2026-09-15
  known 2026-10-17
  covers konto
  bank[m20260915] = (on: 2026-09-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from marek to konto amount 500.00 PLN) "14-marek.json ledger row 2, pozyczka"

ask g1_net_change: sum(flows(x, 2026-03-12) for x in places over .. where not x in outside)
,21:records/2024-01.tally,9436:part bank_2024_01
  tally 2
  note "The prototype's bank history for 2024-01, synthetic (ledger.json, seed 20261017): no bank record was ever used. Written by to_tally.py; links by P1's rule: wynagrodzenie from pracodawca fulfils my_pay of the month before, from pracodawca_zony wife_pay of the month before, czynsz rent_pay of the month; no other row is linked."

