source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input wl: date
input pq: date
input pf: date
input pg: date
input a1: money PLN
input go: bool

move md: transfers
  on pq
  at wl
  for month_of(pf)
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1

move me: transfers
  on pq
  at wl
  for month_of(pg)
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1

move mw: transfers
  on pq
  at wl
